Third-party code
================

WZIP and WLZ4 are distributed under the BSD 2-Clause License (LICENSE). Three source files contain code derived
from other projects, used under their licenses, which are reproduced below.

src/WLZ4.c, src/WLZ4.h: the block layout, the literal and match copy helpers, the decoding loop structure and
parts of the interface and its comments are derived from LZ4 (https://github.com/lz4/lz4).

src/Memry.h: the unaligned memory access functions and their configuration are derived from Zstandard's
lib/common/mem.h (https://github.com/facebook/zstd), and the wild-copy helpers from LZ4.

The benchmark harness (bench/) links against LZ4, Zstandard, Brotli and liblzma, each under its own license;
their sources are not included in this repository.

